  message: "Similarity warnings at add time reviewed 2026-11-04: WI-biguz (ExternalRef.name free-text justification) and WI-gidob (swift-nio overlay row) are unrelated. Real prior art: WI-bulag / WI-gajir / WI-mubak (the T9 resource_naming annotation on io_primitives rows and its soundness guard: a MIXED sink cannot be attributed because the walk carries no argument identity — this item supplies that identity); WI-lunav (done: request/command builders 'need argument-position adjudication'); WI-gohok / WI-jivih (the source-side value_shape sizing, declined under 5%). Measurement 0032 §7 is the design; §4 is the self-tree table the instrument must reproduce."  # ea25
